WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
- So in addition to
Rob's backstage popcorn,

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:05.340
the brothers have been working
on another exciting venture,

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:08.233
their upcoming residency in Las Vegas.

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:09.680
- Yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.680 --> 00:00:11.500
- I'm so excited to come see this.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:13.340
Like I said, I loved your show so much

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.173
when I saw you at the Bowl.

00:00:14.173 --> 00:00:15.529
So I'm so stoked about this.

00:00:15.529 --> 00:00:17.696
What's new? What's gonna be happening?

00:00:17.696 --> 00:00:18.650
- Well, there's a lot.

00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:22.370
I mean, we haven't played a
show since October last year.

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:23.790
And so we're obviously
very excited to get back

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:25.120
on the stage.

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.130
And you know, this residency was actually

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:29.510
supposed to happen pre
COVID and then COVID hits.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:31.510
So this is a long time overdue for us

00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:33.670
to bring an exciting show
to our fans in Vegas.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.270
And you know, it's a
great town for live music

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.654
and I just can't wait to
get out there and play.

00:00:37.654 --> 00:00:38.487
- Yeah.
(audience cheering)

00:00:38.487 --> 00:00:40.104
- Oh my God. So it's supposed
to happen a long time ago.

00:00:40.104 --> 00:00:41.580
- Yeah.
- Oh man.

00:00:41.580 --> 00:00:43.840
- Maybe some special guests.
Maybe, hey, you show up.

00:00:43.840 --> 00:00:45.680
- That's exciting. Don't
invite me, mama will show up.

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:47.382
- Kevin just volunteered
you to join us on stage.

00:00:47.382 --> 00:00:48.345
- Yeah.
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:49.178
- This is how things get done.

00:00:49.178 --> 00:00:50.681
- Kelly Clarkson's gonna
performing with us every night.

00:00:50.681 --> 00:00:53.810
- I will just show up. I'm
just gonna show up singing.

00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:55.280
I hear that you're back
in the studio though,

00:00:55.280 --> 00:00:56.318
so I'm excited about that.
- Yeah.

00:00:56.318 --> 00:00:58.241
- I love your record.
(audience cheering)

00:00:58.241 --> 00:01:00.010
- When we're back in the studio,
we're writing, recording,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:01.830
and getting that process started,

00:01:01.830 --> 00:01:03.370
and finding inspiration everywhere.

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.850
So we're ready to get it
out there for the world,

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.237
hopefully by the end of
this year, we'll see.

00:01:08.237 --> 00:01:09.628
(audience cheering)
That's so exciting.

00:01:09.628 --> 00:01:11.414
- I love it. Look at him
looking at them like.

00:01:11.414 --> 00:01:16.341
Right?
(Kelly and Nick laughs)

